@startuml
title RAG Nodes in DeepResearch Flow

[*] --> coordinator
coordinator --> rewrite_multi_query
rewrite_multi_query --> background_investigator
rewrite_multi_query --> user_file_rag
user_file_rag --> background_investigator
background_investigator --> planner
planner --> information
information --> research_team
research_team --> professional_kb_decision
professional_kb_decision --> professional_kb_rag
professional_kb_rag --> reporter
reporter --> [*]

note right of user_file_rag
  用户文件RAG节点
  使用RagNodeService创建
end note

note right of professional_kb_rag
  专业知识库RAG节点
  使用RagNodeService创建
end note

@enduml
